// # emit-x86 while leftover honesty
//
// Logline: Loop forever printing once so emit-x86 must ERR leftover and not emit a silent once.
//
// Setup: Fold misses. while is not walked. Inner println must not become _start.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Declare main.
//   2. while true prints once.
//   3. emit-x86 must print ERR x86_emit.

pub fn main() {
    while true {
        println("once");
    }
}
